  (text "Unused GPIOs (PC13-15, PA2-4, PA7, PA10, PB2, PB4, PB5, PB10, PC6, PC7, PC12, PD2):\n10k pull-down to GND each (R90-R105). PA4 is kept free for DAC1_OUT1 (Test_pin_DAC)."
